    "health_features_science": {
      "type": "health-features",
      "blocks": {
        "feat_1": {
          "type": "_health-feature",
          "settings": {
            "text": "It's The Most Biocompatible Metal For The Human Body.",
            "body": "<p>Pure titanium is chemically stable in cooking and prep conditions. It won't leach into food, disrupt hormones, or trigger allergic reactions.</p>",
            "side": "left"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "feat_2": {
          "type": "_health-feature",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Completely Toxin-Free (By Design).",
            "body": "<p>That's why surgeons trust it in the body. It doesn't break down, flake, or release particles - what goes in your food stays food.</p>",
            "side": "right"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "feat_3": {
          "type": "_health-feature",
          "settings": {
            "text": "It Naturally Kills Bacteria (Extremely Hygienic).",
            "body": "<p>Titanium's dense, non-porous surface leaves nowhere for bacteria to hide, grow, or spread between uses.</p>",
            "side": "left"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "feat_4": {
          "type": "_health-feature",
          "settings": {
            "text": "It Never Rusts Or Degrades.",
            "body": "<p>Steel corrodes because oxygen turns it into rust. Titanium reacts differently, forming a stable oxide layer that protects it forever.</p>",
            "side": "right"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "feat_5": {
          "type": "_health-feature",
          "settings": {
            "text": "It's Completely Non-Reactive & Acid-Resistant.",
            "body": "<p>Tomatoes, citrus, vinegar, oils - all harmless against titanium. While other metals react and alter flavor, titanium stays neutral.</p>",
            "side": "left"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "feat_6": {
          "type": "_health-feature",
          "settings": {
            "text": "It Withstands Extreme Heat Day After Day.",
            "body": "<p>Titanium doesn't warp, crack, or fatigue under extreme temperature changes, even after years of daily use.</p>",
            "side": "right"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "feat_7": {
          "type": "_health-feature",
          "settings": {
            "text": "It Preserves Nutrients.",
            "body": "<p>Reactive metals can strip vitamins like Vitamin C from food through oxidation. Titanium keeps nutrients intact, so your meals deliver what nature intended.</p>",
            "side": "left"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "feat_8": {
          "type": "_health-feature",
          "settings": {
            "text": "It Endures Stress.",
            "body": "<p>Thanks to its unique crystal structure, titanium becomes more resistant with every cut, impact, or use. Instead of weakening, it hardens.</p>",
            "side": "right"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "feat_9": {
          "type": "_health-feature",
          "settings": {
            "text": "It Outlasts Generations.",
            "body": "<p>One titanium board or pan replaces dozens of wood, plastic, or coated alternatives. It's not just long-lasting, it's heirloom quality.</p>",
            "side": "left"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "feat_1",
        "feat_2",
        "feat_3",
        "feat_4",
        "feat_5",
        "feat_6",
        "feat_7",
        "feat_8",
        "feat_9"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Real Pure Titanium. Real Benefits.",
        "heading_color": "#bca588",
        "heading_font_size": 48,
        "heading_font_size_mobile": 24,
        "subheading": "<p>Not all titanium is created equal. Most cut costs by using titanium coatings, blends, or lower grades that compromise purity and safety.</p><p>At Taima®, we only use Grade 1 Certified Medical Titanium - the purest form possible, the same titanium trusted inside the human body for decades. No mixing. No coating. Just uncompromising purity engineered for your kitchen and your safety.</p>",
        "background_color": "#03231a",
        "item_text_color": "#d4c7b4",
        "item_active_text_color": "#ffffff",
        "content_max_width": 1920,
        "items_gap": 40,
        "items_gap_mobile": 16,
        "padding_block_start": 80,
        "padding_block_end": 80,
        "padding_inline_start": 160,
        "padding_inline_end": 160,
        "padding_block_start_mobile": 56,
        "padding_block_end_mobile": 56,
        "padding_inline_start_mobile": 0,
